flowchart LR
  Req[Incoming request] --> Auth{Authenticated?}
  Auth -->|yes| Scope{Has scope?}
  Scope -->|yes| Rate{Within quota?}
  Rate -->|yes| Route[Route to service]
  Route --> Ok([200 OK])
  Auth -->|no| E401[401 Unauthorized]
  Scope -->|no| E403[403 Forbidden]
  Rate -->|no| E429[429 Too many requests]

  %% @main Req Auth Scope Rate Route Ok
  %% @exit Auth -> E401, Scope -> E403, Rate -> E429
